<!-- Cellular Installs: the one Shortcut for This iPhone installs on cellular data (CellularShortcut.swift). Its
     input is a JSON dictionary with one key, read with Get Dictionary Value and tested with "has any value" only (a
     "contains" condition loses its text on import). Without input it does nothing.
       {"run":1}    cellular data off, Open for Install, 15 Wait for Install turns (20 s each at most: Shortcuts cuts
                    an action off at 30 s; they end at once when every waiting install is connected), cellular data
                    on, Finish Cellular Installs. The app has its VPN up first: iOS starts none without a network
       {"on":1}     cellular data on, Open for Install, Finish Cellular Installs: puts back what a run didn't
       {"check":1}  Open for Install, Wait for Install, Finish Cellular Installs: touches no data
     tools/shortcuts/sign.sh signs it. -->
